H('56.d.4.A',3,"Historical advances such as improved rootstocks are important because they:","Helped protect vines from pests and improve production",["Ended grape growing","Replaced all vineyards","Had no effect"],"Rootstock resistance saved many vineyards.")
H('56.d.4.A',4,"The spread of European grapevines to the Americas led to:","New vineyard regions and new pests to manage",["No vineyards","Only wild grapes","Fewer people drinking"],"Moving vines also moved diseases such as phylloxera.")
H('56.d.4.B',3,"An emerging technology in vineyards is:","Drones and sensors that monitor vine health",["Hand counting only","Paper maps only","Candle-based irrigation"],"Technology improves monitoring.")
