H('56.d.4.C',3,"A current trend in viticulture is growing interest in:","Sustainable and organic practices",["Using no water","Abandoning vineyards","Ignoring climate"],"Consumers value sustainability.")
H('56.d.4.C',4,"Climate change has pushed growers to consider:","Heat-tolerant varieties and new vineyard sites",["Growing only one variety","Ignoring weather","Planting in shade"],"Growers adapt to warming trends.")

