H('56.d.5.F',4,"A benefit of training vines onto wires is:","Better sunlight exposure and airflow",["Less light","More humidity","Weaker vines"],"Canopy management reduces disease.")

H('56.d.6.A',3,"A good vineyard site generally has:","Well-drained soil and adequate sunlight",["Standing water","Deep shade","Constant flooding"],"Drainage and light are key.")
